<p>Ghazi Madad ko aao Ghazi Madad ko aao<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>1. Aayi ek qayamat liye haye shaame Ghareebaa'n<br />
Naizo'n ki aniyou'n pa jab chadar hui ayaa'n<br />
Har bibi ke labo'n par thi us waqt yahi sada<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>2. Shimre maloon ka wo jab khayi hai tamaacha<br />
Gohar Sakina(s.a) ke shaqi jab cheen ne laga<br />
Besaaqta tadap kar ye karne lagi fughaa'n<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>3. Qaime jale hain haye sab asbaab lut gaya<br />
Masoom Ali Asghar(a.s) ka jhoola bhi jal gaya<br />
Bistar ko khainchte hi bas Sajjad(a.s) ne kaha<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>4. Oonto'n ki nangi pusht par baithi thi bibiyaa'n<br />
Sab haath to bandhe the, na thi amariyaa'n<br />
Maao'n ki goud se gire bacche to di sada<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>5. Aulaad e Ali(a.s) saamne hai nange sar khadi<br />
Hai bughze Ali(a.s) tumko to badle ki hai ghadi<br />
Aawaaze shaqi sun ke ye Zainab(s.a) ne ye kaha<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

<p>6. Beshak imaam e Asr(a.s) ka hoga zahooor ab<br />
saaraate Hussain(a.s) ho bedaar shaoor Ab<br />
lena hai inteqaam ab khoone Hussain(a.s) ka<br />
Jald aao ... Ghazi Madad ko aao</p>

